      157["<div style='font-weight: bold'>IDE host</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Software System]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>What the drive is plugged<br />into: a retro PC's IDE<br />controller (16-bit ISA card,<br />Intel PIIX, VIA) or a USB-IDE<br />adapter (JMicron, Innostor).<br />Drives the 40-pin IDE bus:<br />register reads and writes,<br />PIO and multiword DMA data,<br />RESET#.</div>"]
      style 157 fill:#999999,stroke:#6b6b6b,color:#ffffff
    end

